\title{Feedback, credit, and parameter updates}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{notes}

\p{A completed trajectory becomes training data only after the protocol records
its provenance and interprets its evidence. This section separates the stored
event from later selection, credit assignment, and parameter updates. The
separation is necessary for replay and update gating.}

